      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1996694",
      "line": 70,
      "start": 16,
      "end": 27,
      "source_quote": "次晏，侍中、光祿大夫。",
      "reading": "范泰子晏另任光祿大夫，兩謝靈運傳均具名泰／㤗，不以官名獨判。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
