      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2370105",
      "line": 70,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18,
      "source_quote": "秋八月壬戌，特進、左光祿大夫范泰卒。",
      "reading": "元嘉五年八月。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "source-evidence/jin079-shang-xuan/external/song067-ws2605593.wikitext",
      "raw_sha256": "06993eea82bc40c64cfbcaa85ef321097bcf522d27bb67e54a111ece05421395",
      "revision": 2605593,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2605593",
      "line": 179,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 43,
      "source_quote": "太祖登祚，誅徐羨之等，徵為祕書監，再召不起，上使光祿大夫范泰與靈運書敦奬之，乃出就職。",
      "reading": "與四庫本同一事件、同任務、同收件人，數位固定本作泰。"
